Package: ORBIT
Title: Omic Rank-Based Integration Tools
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Zifeng", "Qiu", , "qiuzifeng4518@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Yang", "Luo", , "yang.luo@kennedy.ox.ac.uk", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Integrates summary-level multi-omic data using the
    Variance-Gamma distribution to identify features that consistently
    rank highly in one direction across omics. Each omic is supplied as
    a list of ordered values (e.g., p-values) over a shared feature
    space (e.g., genes), and the package returns a p-value and
    direction for each feature.
